 Taylor Sheridan has been on an absolute roll in 2026, moving with the confidence of someone who knows exactly what audiences want. The Yellowstone creator has unleashed tragedy in The Madison , pitted criminals against law enforcement officers in Marshals , brought Beth and Rip back in Dutton Ranch , and continued his run with Lioness and Tulsa King . Now, Sheridan is turning his attention to Texas suburbia, where a familiar face is ready to cause havoc. Get ready for the crime thriller Frisco King .
